        """ Responsys.retrieveTableRecords call

        Accepts:
            InteractObject table
            string query_column
                possible values: 'RIID'|'EMAIL_ADDRESS'|'CUSTOMER_ID'|'MOBILE_NUMBER'
            list field_list
            list ids_to_retrieve

